<title>USA: Option Care expands to Chicago market.</title>
<headline>Option Care expands to Chicago market.</headline>
<dateline>BANNOCKBURN, Ill. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Option Care Inc said Tuesday it awarded a franchise to Infusion Services of America Inc that will cover Chicago and surrounding communities.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>Option Care said the deal gives the company a presence in 16 of the top 20 U.S. markets nationwide. The company added it has signed 28 new franchise agreements since January of 1995.</p>
<p>Option Care provides home health care services through a national network of 184 franchised and company-owned locations.</p>
<p>The company's shares closed unchanged Tuesday at 6-5/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
